# Fork-only GitHub workflow

This checkout is a personal fork. Do not contribute to LuxAlgo from it.

- `origin` is `joveteo/trade-journal`. Push branches only there.
- Open pull requests only on that fork: `gh pr create --repo joveteo/trade-journal --base main`. Always pass `--repo joveteo/trade-journal`. Omitting `--repo` is not safe: `gh` defaults fork PRs to the parent repository.
- Never pass `--repo LuxAlgo/trade-journal`. Never open, push, or file issues against LuxAlgo.
- `upstream` is `LuxAlgo/trade-journal` for fetch only. Do not push to it.
